+*   **Sign Preservation:** The second derivative is signed [S2, unofficial]. Failing to apply scale and bias to maintain the sign will result in incorrect interpolation between positive and negative curvature regions [S2, unofficial].
 *   **Separability Trade-off:** Implementing the transfer function as separable 2D and 1D functions reduces texture size but reduces control over the mapping types [S1].
 
